      <abstract>
        <para>
          The Performance Co-Pilot (PCP) analysis toolkit collects, processes,
          and analyzes system performance metrics, either in real time or from
          archived logs. &productname; provides PCP as regular packages, so
          you install and configure it like any other system service, without
          needing a container runtime. This makes it straightforward to
          monitor a single system locally or to centralize monitoring for
          several remote systems on one host.
        </para>
        <para><emphasis>Prerequisites:</emphasis></para>
